'''Beastly Nero''' (魔肖ネロ ''Mashō Nero'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Beastly Nero
|image = E 455.png
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
|appearance = [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
Beastly Nero has high damage output and Omni Strike, making him very hard to deal with. Although he can be countered easily when non-magnified, this enemy appears in the Devils Strike gauntlet, meaning that he will usually have much better stats that will allow him to plow through cats like nothing, although not very quickly.

